window.products.push({"id":858018,"name":"MAXIJIN Newest Jacquard Sofa Covers for 3 Cushion Couch, Super Stretch Non Slip Couch Cover for Dogs Pet Friendly 1-Piece Elastic Furniture Protector ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FQzzUHzhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEWEST DESIGN - Are you looking for a way to protect your sofa while decorating the home? Try our creative design large checker jacquard couch covers for 3 cushion couch! It is embellished with unique three-dimensional checks, it not only looks modern and nice, but also feels smooth, extra soft, delicate, and thick. High quality fabrics are durable for long term usage. Available in various vibrant colors for choose, perfectly fit any living room decoration SUPER STRETCHY - MAXIJIN magic sofa cover is made of 95% polyester and 5% spandex cloth. Due to the addition of high density stretchable spandex fiber, it will easily fit whether your sofa is big or small, no deformation. A real universal couch cover for fitting most fabric or leather t-cushion couches, high back couches. Adopts natural active printing and dyeing process, so the fabric color is more beautiful. Healthy and Eco friendly. Breathable and comfortable for summer REAL ANTI-SLIP - Bonus with foam rods in the package, tucking into the creases of sofa seat cushion after installation of slipcovers, not only to make the fitted couch slipcover looks neat and wrinkle-free, just like a custom-made couch protector cover for your sofa. It also prevents the slipcover from moving when a person stands up or the pet jumps. Moreover, there is an elastic band on furniture cover to wrap around sofa bottom tightly for better anti-skid effect FULL PROTECTION - Our one piece premium sofa protector cover adopts the full-coverage design, which fully covers your sofa. Not only make your old sofa new, just like replacing it with a new sofa, but also protect it from stains, dust, wear and sunlight causing sofa to shed or fade, cat, dog hairs, scratches, etc. It will greatly save you the cost and time of maintaining and cleaning your sofa set. Its strapless design makes it very EASY to install and take off for washing SIZE & EASY CARE - Please choose the right slip cover size according to Measuring Guide in photos. The Chair cover fits armchair of 31-46 inches in length, Loveseat cover fits couch of 55-69 inches, Sofa slipcover fits couch of 72-92 inches, XL Sofa cover fits couch of 92-112 inches. Machine Washable separately on the gentle cycle, Do Not Bleach. Tumble dry low. We provide 24*7 friendly customer support and also back our products for 2 Years, 100% RISK-FREE PURCHASE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FQzzUHzhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAXIJIN","source_asin":"B0863G7VWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0863G7VWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0863G7VWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
