window.products.push({"id":858123,"name":"Kulipon Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set, Refillable, Ergonomic Salt and Pepper Shakers, One Handed, Adjustable Coarseness Fine Long-Lasting Batte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FELeZqLFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧂【140 ML Capacity and Safe Food-Grade Material】: Each Kulipon electric salt and pepper grinder has a large 140ML (70ML*2) capacity and the handy brushed food-grade stainless steel body by 2 inch diameter and 9 inch high, you control it very easily by one hand, the transparent acrylic chamber can help you to check and refill the salt and pepper every second. 🧂【Hard Ceramic Grinder and One-Handed Operation】: We use the ultra-hard diamond-like ceramic grinder for each electric salt and pepper mill, you can just push the upside bottom to start it by one hand, it would not get rust, corrode, clogging or jamming for peppercorns, Kosher salt, Himalayan salt or other spices. 🧂【Long Lasting Cordless Battery Operated】Each of Kulipon electric pepper grinder needs 4 AA batteries (not included), just take off the top cover, you can install all batteries in seconds. It can last for months thanks to the energy-saving grinder. It does not need to be charged, you can take it everywhere, indoor or outdoor, like evening dinner, picnic, camping, BBQ for a very long time. 🧂【All-Fitted Modern Design】This electric salt and pepper grinder set has a very simple but all-fitted design, it’s a very good decoration for your dinner table, BBQ, kitchen when it’s not been used. And the bottom built-in warm light can not only light your food up, but also can spice your feeling when using it. 🧂【Perfect Gift and Long-Term Service】Kulipon electric salt and pepper grinder set has a giftable package, it could be your perfect gift for housewarming parties, weddings, holidays, birthdays. All those electric salt and pepper grinders are under high-standard inspection and quality testing before shipping, And we have a 30-day money-back long-term service. If any questions, you can message us we will give you the best solution ASAP.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FELeZqLFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kulipon","source_asin":"B08BPDZKWP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BPDZKWP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BPDZKWP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
