window.products.push({"id":858175,"name":"聚宝盆 Feng Shui Gold Coins 8\" Money Fortune Tree Dragon Pot Bonsai Home Decor Wealth Blessing Gift (Gold Coins TRE101 / D13454)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813ZFRyVKqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since ancient times, there have been stories of a magical “treasure bowl” (ju bao pen 聚宝盆) that can create unlimited riches, and sometimes great sorrow, for its owner. While the actual treasure bowl remains to be found, its image has became a popular symbol of good fortune. One of the best known stories is of a fisherman named Shen Wan San (沈万三) who lived during the late Yuan and early Ming dynasties. One day he saw a person who had caught a large number of frogs to eat. Shen Wan San felt sorry for the frogs. So he bought them and released them into a nearby pond. That night he was awakened by the loud croaking of the frogs. He went to investigate and discovered a clay pot in the midst of the frogs. Shen Wan San took the pot home. By chance, his wife accidentally dropped a silver object into the pot and immediately the pot was filled with silver. As it turned out, the pot was really a “treasure basin” which allowed Shen Wan San to become one of the richest men in Chinese history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813ZFRyVKqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"We pay your sales tax","source_asin":"B018WNJ3NG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018WNJ3NG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018WNJ3NG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
