window.products.push({"id":858210,"name":"SMOUPING Digital Alarm Clock with Temperature & Humidity Display,Dimmer Bedside Clock with USB Charger,Day of Week,12/24H,Dual Alarm & Voice Control, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EFUydcRqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Clear Digital Display: The LED numbers are very uniformly lit, it keeps time with precision, and numbers are clearly visible in daylight or evening hours. In addition to very clear time display, the alarm clock also has real-time temperature(℃/°F) and humidity display. You can always understand the temperature and humidity of the room. Smart Voice Control(Power saving mode): When voice control function is turned on, screen display will automatically become the darkest and light up only when you make a 70db sound or touch the clock lightly. In this mode, the battery can be used for more than 15 days. If you want the screen is always on, please turn off the voice control function. Dual Alarms with 18 Melodies: The alarm can set a weekday and weekend alert according to your needs. Alarm Ringtone including elegant classical music, natural bird sounds, and traditional beep ringtones, which can meet the needs of different people. The sound is max up to 120 decibels, it is enough to wake up every one even heavy sleepers. USB Charger: An extra Type-A USB output port was design for charging. The output power is 5V 1A,which can charge electronic products suitable for this power, such as mobile phones, IPAD and watches. (Note: If you want to charge other devices,the alarm clock must be powered by charger cable.) Snooze/Dimmable: Single button design, the small digital clock display can realize four level brightness adjustment. One minute alarm and five minutes snooze, adjustments are easy and the buttons are clearly labeled and intuitive, the numbers are easy to read from a distance, suitable for the elderly and kids. Battery Operated: Built-in battery. Even if the alarm clock is turned off, the battery still has spare power that can be used for time work. A day, a week, or even a month, when the alarm clock is recharged, it can still display the time correctly without resetting. Power Supply: You can also directly plug in and use it, it can be powered by USB charger, such as mobile phone chargers, computers, and mobile power, which can be powered. There is no harmful for alarm clock. (Packaging Type-C charger cable, not included adapter)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EFUydcRqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMOUPING","source_asin":"B099SC63FF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099SC63FF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099SC63FF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
