window.products.push({"id":858331,"name":"Admetior Digital Spoon Scale, Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b06H6hJ-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get precise measurements of both volume and weight with Admetior's digital spoon scale in black, which comes with two removable spoons and an ergonomic handle with integrated digital display and easy-to-use control button. Where a standard kitchen scale is great for larger amounts, the digital spoon scale is perfect for measuring small, precise amounts of spices, baking powder and even wet ingredients like yogurt. The digital display provides an instant reading, and it provides a measurement to the nearest tenth of a gram or ounce. It can measure a maximum of 300 grams, or 10.58 ounces. It comes with a 3-tablespoon scoop for larger measurements and a 1-1/2-tablespoon scoop that's great for narrower jars. The spoon includes a built-in long-lasting battery and the removable spoons are dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b06H6hJ-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Admetior","source_asin":"B001G5ZBJI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001G5ZBJI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001G5ZBJI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":858332,"name":"Stainless Taco Holders Stand 3 Tacos Each. Heavy Duty Quality! Taco Shell Holders - Taco Stainless Stand - Taco Baking Rack - Soft Taco Stand & Hard T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UQ9NNJb3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Serving Tacos Has Never Been This Easy! Forget the mess and stress of constantly finding ways how to assemble and serve your tacos without seeing the meat, veggies, and other fillings spill over. With our sturdy metal taco rack, you'll be all-smiles serving your version of this all-time favorite Mexican dish to your friends and family. Our sleek and durable taco serving rack will surely make your Taco Tuesdays, weekend picnics, pool parties, and even regular meal times even more fun! Restaurant Heavy Duty Quality! With their size, weight, and design, feel free to use them also for burritos, hotdogs in buns, sandwiches, subs, waffles, corndogs and more! To provide you with utmost convenience, we pride ourselves on never skimping on planning and designing every single detail of our fun taco holders: One value pack gives you two (2) stainless steel taco holders. Each metal taco stand can hold up to 3 tacos at a time. The taco rack measures 8 x 4 x 2 in. and weighs only 7 ounces. Made from food-safe high-grade stainless steel material. Oven-safe (up to 500ºF), grill-safe and dishwasher-safe (top-shelf). Come in a Box of 2.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UQ9NNJb3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zugar Land","source_asin":"B08XLBHW3X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XLBHW3X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XLBHW3X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":858333,"name":"EVERLY 100% Pure Linen Duvet Cover Set King Size 104’’X90’’3pcs (1 Duvet Cover,2 Pillowcases) Soft and Breathable for All Season with Coconut Button C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XOr9283HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% NATURAL LINEN: EVERLY pure linen duvet cover set is made of premium French grown flax, help you fall asleep faster and sleep sounder. With antistatic, the bedding set is friendly for allergies EXQUISITE & DURABLE: Duvet covers and pillowcases have double-stitching edges and sewed with coconut button closure, add a rustic chic feeling to your space. 8 corner ties inside the duvet cover(4 in corners, 4 at midpoints) to ensure the comforter is firmly fixed without slipping SUIT ALL-SEASON: Linen can absorb 20% of its weight in moisture before beginning to feel damp or wet which means it will be breathable and balance your body heat throughout the night. Thus ensuring the cozy sleeping beneath the duvet cover all year round 3 PCS BEDDING SET: Included 1 duvet cover king size(104\" x 90\") and 2 pillowcases(20\"x 36\"), the packaging bag can be used as a storage bag for daily use. Not included the comforter or pillows. Fabulously look make it a perfect housewarming gift for your friends and family CARE INSTRUCTION: Do not bleach, dry clean. Please do not use any detergent with chlorine！Machine wash cold separately with a gentle cycle. Low tumble dries or iron if needed. It is normal for some lint in the first few washes, regular washing will make linen softer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XOr9283HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EVERLY","source_asin":"B0928B6JZD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928B6JZD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928B6JZD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
