window.products.push({"id":858368,"name":"WHW Whole House Worlds Americana Rustic Farmhouse Mirror with Shutters, Vintage Gray, Distressed Metal Border of Braided Flowers, Sustainable Wood, Gl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":96.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8180Ph9L6ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Indulge in the feeling of laid-back luxury and bring reflective depth to your spaces with our Americana Rustic Farm House Mirror. Crafted by hand, this piece features an inset distressed metal border of flowers and braids between the gray wooden framework. At top, the arch is embellished by a metal scrollwork medallion. Given their handmade and hand-finished nature, slight variations in appearance are to be expected and celebrated. Each item is unique and no two are exactly alike Great Size for visual impact: This well-proportioned mirror measures 21 3/4 x 1 1/4 x 28 3/4 inches with the shutters closed. An inspiring accent piece with time worn appeal and a shabby chic finish, this mirror is perfect to create a focal point for your foyer, bedroom or bath or living room. Easy to hang: This mirror is equipped with hanging hook at the back. Use twine or rope for above frame suspension to bring color coordination to a room theme or add your own personal style. A fantastic gift: Ideal for occasions that mark special events such as housewarmings, new babies, birthdays, anniversaries and many more. Enjoy! By Whole House Worlds Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8180Ph9L6ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHW Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B01H6F5QF0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H6F5QF0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H6F5QF0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
