window.products.push({"id":858405,"name":"MOJOSCEND Woven Rope Laundry Hamper Basket with Handles, 58L Tall Clothes Hamper for Blankets Storage in Bedroom, Living Room, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zl8XcDuBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Natrual Cotton Rope 【Natural Laundry Hamper】The round laundry basket is 100% natural woven cotton rope has no Chemical No Nasty No Disgusting Smell, Safe for Intimate Clothing, blankets, throws and toys storage in nursery, baby room, play room, bathroom, bedroom, laundry room, living room. 【58L Large Capacity and Portable Hamper】15D x 20H inches tall hamper is large enough for the family's a week of dirty clothes and keep your room clean and tidy. The double stitching around the handles for better load bearing capacity and long design handle makes it much easier tote to laundry room. Wash clothes once a week, saving more time to enjoy life. 【Durable Laundry Basket】All the stiches of the laundry baskets are distibution and fine, which makes the laundry hamper better wear resistance and durability to be used for many years. Additionally, it soft to touch, yet sturdy enouth to keep shape and stand up on its own. 【Multipurpose Storage Baskets】The cute and elegant hamper provide a nice fine Nordic touch to any room of the house. This elegant storage basket bring great convenience in life to store bulky items like blankets,comforters,duvets,throw pillows,cushions,stuffed animals,winter clothing etc.It offers plenty of space for smaller miscellaneous items, like books,magazines,toys. 【Satisfaction Guarantee】For any reason you're not satisfied with your purchase, please let us know and we will attempt to resolve any issues and ensure your contentment. Additionally, the hamper is shipped in folded form, but it will turn back to its elegant shape quickly if you fill it with some blankets or towels, and use a steamer to remove the crease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zl8XcDuBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOJOSCEND","source_asin":"B09RVSSW2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RVSSW2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RVSSW2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":858406,"name":"Two Large Spatula Silicone Kitchen Utensils, Made of FDA Grade, BPA Free Silicone, Heat Resistant up to 450 Degrees Fahrenheit, Non Stick Stain & Ordo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BhUlNrjLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It’s time to move on to the next generation of kitchen utensils and throw away those old wooden ones that are building up with bacteria. US Lounger Silicone Utensils are made of high quality FDA Grade, BPA free silicone. Our solid silicone surface means no crevices for bacteria to collect and start building. All of our utensils have a solid steel core which makes them wear and tear resistant. There nonstick, and will not scratch up your pots and pans. Not only are they stain resistant but there also dishwasher safe so clean up is easy and stress free. Design with comfort in mind, our the steel core is ergonomically coated in silicone for a comfortable firm grip to handle weight and be easily balanced when handling food. Additionally the silicone is rated for up to 480 degrees Fahrenheit (248 degrees Celsius) so you don’t have to worry about burning or melting your spatulas and turners when handling food at high temperatures. Highlight Features: - FDA Grade, BPA Free Silicone  - Heat Resistant up to 480 degrees F (248 degrees C)  - Non Stick  - Stain Resistant  - Dishwasher Safe Dimensions & Weight: Spoon: Dimensions: 11in x 2in Weight: 3.10 OZ Spatula: Dimensions: 11in x 2.75in Weight: 3.35 OZ Tongs: Dimensions: 10.5in x 1.5in Weight: 4.20 OZ","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BhUlNrjLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"US Lounger","source_asin":"B074XH8K3J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074XH8K3J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074XH8K3J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":858407,"name":"Super Soft Christmas Party Socks in Shatterproof Ball Ornament. Novelty Stocking Stuffer Holds Extra Festive Fuzzy Sock Set for Office Secret Santa, W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tF5uN8f2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Celebrate in style this Christmas in our super soft, colorful socks that come in a personalized ball ornament for easy gift giving. Enjoy the magic of the Yule season with our multicolored sock inside DIY Christmas ornaments that are re-fillable for popular traditions. Clear packaging and a festive message make it easy to add onto a box, bag, gifts or stockings. Is this round ornament reusable? Yes! Just twist to release your comfortable pairs and use the bauble for crafts, decorating or presents. Fill it with candy or small toys, then give as stocking stuffers at xmas. Hang it from the mantel as holiday decorations, or fill a gift basket or sleigh with assorted balls for a cheery look. The ultimate gift idea for everyone on your shopping list! Our Yuletide cozy sox are the best items for that fashionable office coworker, friend, family member or secret Santa. Start a new Christmas Eve style tradition and make funny memories with these thick, colorful footies for the holidays. What size are the socks? Our unique novelty slipper socks for women fit kids, girls of all ages, teens and adults approximately shoe size 6 to 10 (medium to large). You'll love the colorful pattern and soft, fluffy designs perfect for vacation or snow days at home. What’s in the box? Each package contains one 4 (four) inch clear acrylic ball ornament with matching red and white ribbon loop and themed tag saying \"Merry Mistletoes.\" Each ornament contains one pair of slip-resistant fuzzy socks in gray and black plaid. Lifetime 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee! If you aren’t completely satisfied with your order, simply email us, and we will respond within 24 hours to make it right even on the weekends. We absolutely guarantee your satisfaction or your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tF5uN8f2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eucatus","source_asin":"B08J4H714N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J4H714N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J4H714N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
