window.products.push({"id":858415,"name":"BINO | Collapsible Dish Drying Rack, Large - Frosted | Space Saving Folding Dish and Cutlery Drainer for Kitchen | BPA-Free Dish Rack for Drying Crock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lNdOdSSPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Air Dry Dishes Before Storing: The BINO dish dryer is an essential kitchen tool for air-drying dishes and cutlery before storing. It's important for dishes to completely dry before putting them away for sanitary purposes. Our dish drainer offers a practical and clever solution. Quick-drain Design: Our dish drying rack has ridges that keep dishes elevated to quickly dry and drain any excess water. As water pools at the bottom, utensils are air-dried at the same time. Tableware and silverware can be dried in no time. Collapsible Dish Drainer: A drying rack that collapses is a bonus when it comes to storage. From an expanded height of five inches, the dish drainer collapses to less than two inches. This means you can easily find a small spot to store the dish dryer when not in use. Multiple Compartments: Our drying rack for the kitchen counter has separate compartments for utensils, plates, bowls, and other items. There are four designated slots for spoons, forks, or knives. It's also deep enough to accommodate dishes of different sizes. Durable and Easy to Use: Our collapsible drying rack is made of durable, BPA-free material that doesn't break easily and is resistant to moisture. It's strong enough to be expanded and collapsed repeatedly. The BINO drying dish rack is also ready to use right out of the box. No assembly is required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lNdOdSSPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BINO","source_asin":"B07V9XMQRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V9XMQRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V9XMQRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
