window.products.push({"id":858516,"name":"Great Earth's Organic Bamboo Shredded Memory Foam Pillow - Adjustable Pillow, Includes Extra Shredded Memory Foam to Create a Customized Premium Adjus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VGc0lFZ5S._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Your TOSSING and TURNING NIGHTS are Over! This Queen sized FULLY ADJUSTABLE PILLOW GIVES YOU a CUSTOMIZED SLEEP... Great Earth's Pillows are supplied with an EXTRA PACK OF INNER SHREDDED FOAM FILL so YOU ARE IN CHARGE and can EASILY ADJUST YOUR PILLOWS TO YOUR PERSONAL NEEDS anytime; this means that you will enjoy a more RESTFUL SLEEP and that is vitally important! In addition, the OUTER ORGANIC BAMBOO COVER is easily removable and MACHINE-WASHABLE - this might be the only pillow you ever need! Our Adjustable Queen Size Memory Foam Pillow includes CertiPUR-US CERTIFIED SAFE FOAM inside a zipped case. Our foam is certified to MEET STRICT durability, performance, and EMISSIONS STANDARDS. The outer layer of the Bamboo Covered Memory Foam Pillow is OKEO-TEX CERTIFIED meaning there are NO NASTIES inside or out that you might breathe in, during the 1/3 of your great life that you spend in bed. YOU’LL SLEEP AND BREATHE MUCH EASIER than you would with other cheap, or down-filled pillows. Memory Foam Pillow SIDE SLEEPERS - it is packed ready to go for you or add more fill from the EXTRA BAG till comfortable. BACK SLEEPERS - remove 25% of the shredded foam pillow inner. STOMACH SLEEPERS - remove 40% of the memory foam. The Adjustable memory foam pillow in QUEEN SIZE is LONG enough so if you are someone that sleeps a couple of ways you can MAKE ONE HALF SUITABLE for when you sleep on your BACK and the OTHER HALF SUITABLE for when you roll over to be a TUMMY sleeper. The shredded memory foam pillow has an easily removable ORGANIC BAMBOO PILLOW FABRIC OUTER SLEEVE. Organic Bamboo is a COOLING, SUSTAINABLE, and MACHINE-WASHABLE fabric which is soft on the skin. The Pillow arrives VACUUM PACKED so you know it is safe from air passed on the way to you. It will make you FEEL GOOD as it is very COMFY as well as EARTH-FRIENDLY with a reduced carbon footprint in its RECYCLABLE PACKAGING. VEGAN-FRIENDLY and ANIMAL CRUETLY FREE (no plucked Bird feathers here). AT GREAT EARTH’S, WE’RE PROUD TO DESIGN CONSCIOUS, COMFY BEDDING that YOU and THE EARTH CAN TRUST. We specialize in Premium, SUSTAINABLY MADE Queen bedding products that are responsibly sourced and manufactured – created for you, the planet, and SEVEN GENERATIONS TO COME. If for any reason you don’t love your Bamboo Memory Foam Pillow Queen size, please reach out so we can make it right. All Queen Memory Foam Pillows returned are DONATED TO HOMELESS SHELTERS, and ANIMAL SHELTERS.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VGc0lFZ5S._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Great Earth's","source_asin":"B08K4XTHFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K4XTHFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K4XTHFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
