window.products.push({"id":858565,"name":"CABINET HERO 18\" Sample Pack - 1 Drip Ramp & 1 Slimline, Slip on Cabinet Door Protector Edge Guard - Clear - 3/4\" Thick - 18\" Length (Pack of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zb517OA3L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Before ordering, measure your cabinet door thickness by using a ruler or measuring tape to verify it is between ¾” to 13/16” thick. Length can be trimmed to fit smaller doors The “Drip Ramp” is a versatile slip-on cover to guard the top edge of a cabinet door or drawer front. Specifically designed for high moisture areas Under the sink or on Trash Pull-out Doors. The water diverting ramp redirects liquid that would normally pool on the top edge of the cabinet or run along the cabinet face by forcing it outward way from the cabinet. The thin design can fit cabinets with tight closures such as face frame, Euro, and Inset style cabinets. The “Slimline” is a low profile slip-on cover to guard the top edge of a cabinet door or drawer front. The thin design can fit cabinets with tight closures such as face frame, Euro and Inset style cabinets. It can also be placed on the side or bottom edge of a door/drawer to protect against nicks from brooms or vacuums when cleaning. Easily protect your cabinets from daily wear, discoloration, chipping, peeling, and water drips without sacrificing your kitchen’s appearance. No adhesive is needed to secure the guard. Simply slip the guard off when needed to reveal clean cabinets. Proudly made in the USA out of a rigid clear plastic that is trimmable with scissors or a utility knife. US Design Patent # US D873,591 S & US Utility Patent # US 10,646,041 B1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zb517OA3L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cabinet Hero","source_asin":"B07NZG1KV8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NZG1KV8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NZG1KV8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
