window.products.push({"id":858610,"name":"Black Cube Quick Release Cookware Chef's Pan, 9.5-Inch/2.5 Quart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jer5rSH0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ULTIMATE COOKING SURFACE: With the Black Cube Quick Release chef's pan, your food cooks on raised stainless-steel pixels, and a recessed nonstick layer makes for easy cleanup. The PFOA-free coating is scratch-resistant and safe for use with metal utensils. This pot heats up quickly, is oven-safe up to 500°F, and can be used on all cooktops, including induction. HYBRID PAN: Welcome to the world’s first hybrid chef's frying pan with the ultimate cooking surface. This pan cooks like stainless steel and cleans like a nonstick pan. Black Cube cookware features a textured surface for superior browning that is easy to clean. With this revolutionary new cooking surface, you get all the benefits of stainless steel and nonstick cookware with no compromise. PROFESSIONAL GRADE: This Black Cube Quick Release chef's pan measures 9.5 inch diameter with a capacity of 2.5 quarts. Whenever you sauté or fry with a Black Cube Quick Release chef's pan, you become a chef in your own kitchen. Stainless-steel cookware doesn’t get much better than this. This large pan is so well designed that you will be inspired to try new recipes often! It is perfectly balanced and weighted with comfortable, sturdy, and ergonomically shaped handles. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Go ahead and make that special dinner without worrying about a hard-to-clean pot. This Black Cube Quick Release chef's pan is every inch the time-saver that you’ve been looking for. It’s not only scratch-resistant but also dishwasher-safe, oven-safe, and extra-easy to clean. FRIELING: Since 1988, Black Cube’s manufacturer, Frieling, has specialized in fresh solutions. That means passionately developing and sourcing functional and well-designed products of the highest quality. The Frieling mission is to solve problems for our customers, which is why Black Cube is one of our brands of distinction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jer5rSH0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Black Cube","source_asin":"B015TGHCEG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015TGHCEG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015TGHCEG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
