window.products.push({"id":858625,"name":"Lewondr Soap Dispenser Bottle with Sponge Compartment, 220ml/7.44oz Countertop Hand Lotion Pump Bottle, Resin Soap Dispenser with Marble Surface, Refi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gLLHCkVtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌺 High Quality Dispenser Bottle - Made of natural resin + grit material, non-toxic, durable and sturdy; easy to clean, can be rinsed with water(0-104℉). Combined smooth round edge and exquisitely marble texture, add a touch of modern and beauty to your house. 🌺 Sponge Compartment Design - Featured with a square sponge holder, this 2 in 1 functional dispenser bottle can hold steel wool or small sponges, make the countertop clean and tidy. Pump head design make the soap dispenser leak-proof and easy to squeeze out the lotion without fatigue. No wastage the last drop of lotion. 🌺 Refillable & Reusable - Comes with wide bottle caliber, convenient to refill and clean, easy to transfer another liquid into this dispenser bottle after cleaning. Washable and reusable, can be reused for a long time. Put the soap dispenser in a ventilated place for 2-3 days to disperse the smell when you use for the first time. 🌺 Large Capacity - 220ml/7.44oz marble dispenser bottle, caliber: 0.67\"/1.7cm, accommodate various kinds of liquids for home use; sponge holder length: 2.76\"/7cm, width: 2.17\"/5.5cm, please confirm the size before buying. 🌺 Wide Application - This dispenser bottle can hold all kinds of liquid, such as shampoo, shower gel, dishwasher detergent, emulsion, liquid soap, massage oil, hand sanitizer, facial cleanser and so on. Perfect for bathroom sink, bathtub, kitchen, hotel, long trip, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gLLHCkVtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lewondr","source_asin":"B08QR923LS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QR923LS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QR923LS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
