window.products.push({"id":858628,"name":"iChef by Maverick Wireless WiFi Thermometer - Wifi Dual Probe Meat Thermometer for Phones and Tablets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tp45T1FQL._AC_SL1396_.jpg","description":"Wireless Wi-Fi wonder! Do you love slowly cooking a quality cut of meat, but hate playing the waiting game? With the iChef Roasting Thermometer from Maverick, you can monitor food’s progress from anywhere in range of your Wi-Fi router. This advanced indoor/outdoor system includes a sleek base unit with LCD display, two temperature probes, an easy quick-start guide, and USB charger for keeping the battery fully powered. Both amateur and seasoned home chefs will enjoy programming unlimited timers and precise temperature settings via the free iOS Apple AppStore, Amazon Appstore or Google Play app. Featuring 7 free recipes, preprogrammed food doneness settings, pinpoint tracking, integrated social media, and tons of other wireless features, the app gives you ultimate control without having to step foot in the kitchen. Want to be a tech savvy meat-roasting master? With the help of a compatible smartphone or tablet, cooking convenience is just a swipe away! Precision Monitoring System The iChef ET-736 by Maverick brings you complete cooking support and the ultimate freedom to move about your home as the Wi-Fi compatible monitor closely tracks food’s temperature within a 4°F to 572°F range. The weatherproof base includes two removable 34” probes with extra high heat resistance. Although most people cook meat under 500°F, our durable probes can withstand temperatures up to 716°F. This means you can house them safely inside a closed grill or oven while your food cooks to perfection. (Probe clips not included). What's Included: One Maverick ET-736 Wireless WiFi Thermometer One USB Charging Cable and Wall Adapter Two High Heat Probes (up to 716F) Quick Start Guide for Use and Phone/Tablet Connection","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tp45T1FQL._AC_SL1396_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maverick","source_asin":"B07TNS76QZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TNS76QZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TNS76QZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
