window.products.push({"id":858649,"name":"Plastic Knife Sheath, Knife Edge Guard Protectors, Universal Knife Cover Sleeves, Set Of 7 Knife Blade Guard Application For 3.5/5/7/8 Inch Japanese C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bBRd-3RtL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"These lightweight, and easy-to-use knife guards are perfect for any chef or kitchen thanks to near universal knife support. From chopping knives to meat cleavers, we’ve got you covered. Product Features: -Keeping kitchen knives in drawers, they can easily get nicked up, damaged, or dulled quickly; more importantly, they could cut you when you reach into the drawer if not properly protected.-Knife sheath set that helps better protect your wide blades while also making it safer for you to rummage around in your kitchen drawers without fear of cutting your fingers or hands.-Protects knife cases is easy to use, fits most brand and easy to clean.-Store and transport knives safely without damaging or dulling their blade edge; protects the edges of your knives and your fingers.-Brown colors help identify knives easily in a drawer or in a knife roll.- Fared top has a wider opening so you can safely insert your knife blade into the guard. Works for your chef's knives, cleavers, butcher knives, chopping knives, santoku knives, filet knives, bread knives, boning knives, serrated slicers, carving knives and meat cleavers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bBRd-3RtL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HERSENT","source_asin":"B07VVKJXTN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VVKJXTN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VVKJXTN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
