window.products.push({"id":858772,"name":"JIELAIMI Self Adhesive Hooks White, 10 Pack Sticky Hooks Extra Strong for Kitchen, Bathroom, Sink - Waterproof Carbon Steel Stick Hanger on Towel Hook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+irYwo1pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ EASY TO INSTALL: Wall hangers hooks without nails and drills. Peel off the self-adhesive cover and then stick the hook on the smooth surface. Please use the adhesive hooks after 24 hours of installation. ★ EXTENDED STICK ON HOOKS DESIGN: The length of the hook is up to 3 cm. This makes it easier to hang handbags with wider straps, hats, and clothes with wide collars. Adhesive hooks provide enough extra strength and durability to hold your items. But I have to be honest, if you use it in a hot environment, its lifespan will be shortened. ★ WATERPROOF AND RUSTPROOF MATERIAL: The JIELAIMI small black and white wall hooks stick on adopt a carbon steel anti-rust material. The chrome sticky hooks extra strong for Hanging are made of stainless steel. And Their exterior are coated with safety waterproof paint which are safe and BPA free. ★ WIDE APPLICATION: The wall hangers hooks without nails are multifunctional in bedroom kitchen, bath and household for hat towels, rags, bath towels, bathrobe, clothes. Please do NOT use on painted walls, because it might damage the paint. ★ ONE (1) YEAR WARRANTY SERVICE: The MAX LOAD of the JIELAIMI self adhesive hooks is 4 kg. when you are using it, the sticky hooks for hanging fall off within one year without overweight. We will replace you with a set of new wall hooks for free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+irYwo1pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JIELAIMI","source_asin":"B0BYZF6ZMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYZF6ZMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYZF6ZMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
