window.products.push({"id":858894,"name":"Slotted Stainless Steel Spatula - Metal Egg Turner for Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LO5ZOQQYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This spatula dishwasher safe is perfect for flipping pancakes, fish, omelettes, wok stir-fry, BBQ and more and would not scratch pots and pans. The stainless steel kitchen spatula features a steel head that is perfect for picking up and flipping both large and small foods. High quality stainless steel of kitchen metal spatula to ensure long-lasting use and an easy clean, they won't dent, crack, rust, or chip.Stainless steel construction of stainless steel slotted turner prevents rust while a handle provides comfort. The handle of metal slotted turner is made at the perfect length to keep your hands on a safe distance from heat and still gives you maximum control over your food. The beveled head of stainless steel turner glides effortlessly under fish fillets and quesadillas, and transfers warm cookies from baking sheet to cooling rack with ease.Our stainless steel slotted spatula is dishwasher safe and provides quick and easy cleanup when cooking with any foods. This slotted turner stainless steel is strong and durable, made to last for a long time. Whether effortlessly flipping a burger or sauteing a medley of summer vegetables, this egg spatula stainless steel will work sensationally with all your cookware.The stainless steel handle of metal spatula turner is made at the perfect length to keep your hands on a safe distance from heat and still gives you maximum control over your food. Front edge of metal turner is very thin and angled, making it easy to get under foods for flipping and turning. The metal egg spatula for flipping eggs, omelets, burgers, hash browns, pancakes and more.The stainless steel spatula surface allows for easy food preparation or serving. Easy lifting and flipping with our ergonomically designed metal kitchen spatula which allows you to handle your food conveniently. You can either choose to clean this spatula metal by hand or you can use your dishwasher without any problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LO5ZOQQYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OFXDD","source_asin":"B081D5LV7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-858894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081D5LV7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081D5LV7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
